# Until SETTLE_WINNING_BID_DELAY_SECONDS have passed since the end of the auction, only the winning bidder may settle
# (Error_OnlyBidderCanSettleYet, 1044).  Entry 12 2 0 was won by rich_user1; rich_user2 and the admin are both
